{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "9329d57e667a732b7413991fbdd7a4da02044ac1433230c31a3443b22b01b910", "ja": "オトナは、せつない？", "zh": "大人，也是会悲伤的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c0dc60679cf3875597d4170108897ca4e320dc31d0aa9e88d0a9a67f96cdb21d", "ja": "集まりに遅刻した紗代子を探すと、千鶴と歌\nの練習中だった。一同は千鶴にせつなさのコ\nツを尋ねるが、答えは練習で身につくような\n内容ではなかった。悩むメンバーにプロデュ\nーサーは、気分転換に行こうと提案する。", "zh": "寻找迟到了的紗代子时，发现她正在和千鹤练习唱歌。大家向千鹤请教表现悲伤的诀窍，可她的回答并不是靠练习就能掌握的内容。面对苦恼的成员们，制作人提议大家去转换一下心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b16d32f275141ad19a74f199470fecc3926a8da6f6d611693aeb287ecb0e1726", "ja": "（今日はアクアリウスのメンバーと、ステージ演出の\n打ち合わせ……の、予定だったものの……）", "zh": "（今天原本预定要和水瓶座的成员们开会讨论舞台演出……可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "8261da9230e3cf25633ff0cc3bc8ba86d82b4581c7c7cae6d1a97776977d18ec", "ja": "サヨが遅れるなんて、めずらしいな。ウチらで遅刻\nするのは、あたしかレイって決まってるんだけど。", "zh": "纱代迟到还真少见啊。按理说，我们几个里会迟到的，都是我或者丽，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "85a9123e5e8e3097ec73dcaf550a03495e2e4ebc8e5c8de09e75b22015384f4e", "ja": "めずらしいよね。あっ、もしかして、\n遅刻っていう新境地へのチャレンジとか？", "zh": "确实很少见呢。啊，难道说，这是在挑战“迟到”这一新境界？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e3e56499045227246f067d50cf24cd7f131c0706883d44402ee3c4090c0cab8f", "ja": "そんなチャレンジはしないと思うけど……\n待てよ？　チャレンジ……？", "zh": "我应该不会挑战这种事吧……\n等等？挑战……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "0d3d70c92eb045e81da458f9bb7e9556f787a6f75d38ec21fe8e5baf1406a9da", "ja": "はあ、はあ、はあ……。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊，哈啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "4fb7290d77e1f0cd39066abd56c71076484d4365081892b74b9f164f1bab2c8f", "ja": "やっぱり！\n紗代子ちゃん、みーつけた♪", "zh": "果然！\n找到纱代子啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "2af7f3917ff3a5cf818fadd00aef63d514dbb35a73194f43305d957f96090648", "ja": "いたいた。\nなんだ、千鶴も一緒だったのか。", "zh": "在这里在这里。\n什么嘛，千鹤也在一起啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "933493cf555d1bb1e42628569b74663da5b676d64483c6f20bfe3c6f9b7a6309", "ja": "ごきげんよう……\nあら、{$P$}も。", "zh": "您好……\n哎呀，原来{$P$}先生也在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "55bd1b9080f8cbf50a26b4e8e8deedf00900e10ccafebe1b0574ac21f1b244ac", "ja": "{$P$}？\n麗花さんとジュリアも、どうして3人そろって……", "zh": "{$P$}？\n丽花小姐和茱莉亚也在，怎么3个人都聚齐了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "a6551d16879f7e31841ab42a84e9b6436d4829ec344f9d63fd4e70b9980fedeb", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさいっ！　打ち合わせでしたよね！？\nつい熱中しちゃって……すぐ行きます！", "zh": "啊，抱歉！是要开会对吧！？  \n一不小心太投入了……我马上过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bc99cff7c1aaea5ed39cb2d4f1f662c4f15ed74238c9ae2e5b367996287fd503", "ja": "いや、そんなに急がなくても大丈夫だよ。\n打ち合わせは、少し休んでからにしよう。", "zh": "不用，不用那么着急也没关系的。\n开会的事，稍微休息一下再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "1aa76c4e2e02f625bbb944ee5bb943fb4441b282511308d3744a6af6f1d3b2cc", "ja": "は、はい……すみません……。", "zh": "好、好的……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "605443e4d008504ed672aab12b7c17f6a49e48d407375aca8404bf4aa31240ca", "ja": "ずいぶん頑張ってたみたいだな。\n……千鶴さん、紗代子はどれくらいレッスンを？", "zh": "看起来她一直很努力啊。  \n……千鹤，纱代子练习了多久？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "4a274a350b5b61f8b9322b4a9c03526949b189fc372c1b5b4601375bc1bd8df7", "ja": "1時間ほどですわ。でも……ご安心くださいまし。\nあまり根を詰めすぎないよう、見ていましたから。", "zh": "大约1小时。不过……请放心。\n我一直留意着，没让她练得太拼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7f7d399c76a87680c2cb19097530cedd61509cc8f6fd4c84d0ab9c1951e7248e", "ja": "……助かりました。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "……帮大忙了。非常感谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "1c892813f6c23133ff841211d83b19595c4cf36c9641074fd8a3a9c47b90348a", "ja": "ははーん。さては早速、自分なりの歌い方を\n探してみた、ってところか？", "zh": "哈哈——原来如此。看来你已经开始试着寻找属于自己的唱法了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "3a1619947fa0f166121ebd95741cd80500c0d6dec8a34cc81b556897a5cf792a", "ja": "そうなんだけど……はあ、全然ダメみたい。\nやっぱり、なかなか見つからないね。", "zh": "是这样没错……唉，看来完全不行。果然，没那么容易找到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "b4a5ce7e8934aa377b095526c13f5ae06b1b5356552d2dd62bc22da01547502f", "ja": "私がまだ子供ってことなのかなぁ。\n大人っぽい感じを出そうとしても、手応えがなくて。", "zh": "是不是因为我还是个孩子呢。\n想表现出成熟的感觉，却完全没有效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "51e5211f5c1473a8625961400e706f8f40c809163613c39b59f43c1c0eff39ff", "ja": "大人っぽい感じ……？", "zh": "成熟的感觉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "5566896593129db9cc6e555d1627586a5c26885e207b4b1627361056c8a54f92", "ja": "あーそれ、あたしの方がまずいかもなぁ。\n実際、大人じゃないし？", "zh": "啊——那个的话，我这边可能更不妙啊。\n毕竟实际上，我又不是大人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "99e02108617738923e4b00ce97e276761bafde5bad76b64b9ae6022de20e30d1", "ja": "たしかに、あの歌の切なさの表現には、\n大人っぽい雰囲気も必要かもしれないな……。", "zh": "确实，要表现出那首歌的伤感，或许也需要一些成熟的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d3e5d62e6328c27e6c17f5cb73f8d9103a8c32538d180f53c53d663916325124", "ja": "ちなみに紗代子、\n千鶴さんには相談してみたのか？", "zh": "对了，紗代子，你有没有找千鹤商量过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "f7e2c5a36d945ec63e057359524056f70f86ef8d164324d67a78b4e1f1ef3817", "ja": "え？　……あっ、そうか！\n千鶴さん！！", "zh": "诶？……啊，对了！\n千鹤小姐！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "38d0811e21b9d62a02bbe3d66d96920062f06ca098b956bc2023e7c5bbea2668", "ja": "ひっ！？　な、なんですの？", "zh": "呀！？ 怎、怎么了呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "28c974ce101b518efd510eb32d856d7251582d61a1bf364b3d548813e2f515bc", "ja": "そうか、千鶴なら間違いなく大人だもんな！\nしかも、言っちゃなんだけどレイより大人っぽいし！", "zh": "这样啊，千鹤肯定是大人了嘛！\n而且，虽然这么说不太好，但她比丽更有大人风范！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "2935306a0c120d14af7985e837c8b2e92363218fe4cafc5a0c4d9e2323fa7e3c", "ja": "もう、ジュリアちゃん失礼だよ！\n千鶴ちゃんは私より、ずーっと大人っぽいの！", "zh": "真是的，茱莉亚太失礼了！\n千鹤可是比我要成熟得多呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "2b29235333a8b6940ea75847b3cfcd37971719940f2818d495a7e0115e88a532", "ja": "お、おう……悪かった。", "zh": "哦、哦……抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "ead4c0f002a279148c852fed900e30e9b364dbd813e8e847b113fc17c869ad5e", "ja": "私、ずっとレッスンに夢中で……盲点でした！\n千鶴さん、聞いてもいいですか！？", "zh": "我一直专注于练习……完全没想到这一点！千鶴，我可以问你吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "811813d065d6476f0b890481de99349c1bba2a3d5f5361d44aafb1cc8ad05403", "ja": "も、もちろん、わたくしに答えられることなら、\nなんでも力になりましてよ。", "zh": "当、当然了，只要是我能解答的事，\n我什么都可以帮你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "d5f694102d3c7a24e88de892ea00c3eedcfd87babafb1b3b974a4c18aa928ccf", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　早速ですけど、どうしたら\n大人っぽく、恋愛のせつなさを出せると思いますか？", "zh": "谢谢！虽然有点突然，不过您觉得要怎样才能表现出成熟感和恋爱的苦涩呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "84b42476ac677d95aed61bf54001607ecd40dab2b10be58eeec7dcf10cdfa00e", "ja": "なるほど、大人っぽく恋愛……恋愛ですの！？", "zh": "原来如此，成熟风格的恋爱……恋爱！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "a8ec01fa2461fafef97e6f46fbce643ffd7a1057d1748e70ae25419c09172438", "ja": "はい。……私、前にお姉さんぶって、ウィルゴのみんな\nの恋愛相談に乗ったことがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "是的……我以前还装作大姐姐，听过维尔戈大家的恋爱烦恼……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "80ff9ace4f31dd169c4d72b1a8492728411e1573feac362e3136f6e0e58abf85", "ja": "いざ自分が恋の歌を歌うことになったら、\nなんにも出てこなくて……うう。", "zh": "可一旦轮到自己要唱恋爱歌曲，\n就什么也想不出来了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "daeae52c8c8f2c9b0161d7f4645c761d300ec6262f037eaf2ad7c91f752ad4a9", "ja": "紗代子……。", "zh": "纱代子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "c074431da4ec24acbfcd45aad76ba0f3f754849ad32676c41f17529e12d4b5fc", "ja": "ウィルゴ……シズとユリコと昴か。\nそういや、いい感じに恋の歌を歌ってたっけ。", "zh": "维尔戈……静香、百合子和昴啊。\n说起来，她们之前唱恋爱歌曲时，感觉还挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1035_048rei", "source_sha256": "c2d3a0c60c12552bf99a83a1d45114d0fa5fbb2c176fa7b2c8eee08cc4eeea1c", "ja": "すごいよね～、まだ中学生なのに。\nもしかしたら、ステキな恋を経験しちゃったのかも♪", "zh": "很厉害呢～明明还是初中生。\n说不定，她已经经历过一段美好的恋情了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "f3480c9ad1693545a2ac2447fc5637c6b37f328fc794675b7c202f454deec012", "ja": "ま、マジか！？　最近の中学生はどうなってんだ？\nつーかそういうの、マズいんじゃないのか！？", "zh": "什、真的假的！？现在的初中生都怎么回事啊？\n话说回来，那种事不太好吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "6d3fe23677ef333a5241ad4d4d49cc2863d93a22843e0d3bd1b8ea2187000b86", "ja": "いやまあその話は後にするとして、えーと。\nそれより、どうですか千鶴さん？", "zh": "不，先不说这个了，那个……\n比起那个，你怎么看，千鹤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1038_038chz", "source_sha256": "130bcf211cfc381d7360c92d053ad10a220e4498c14ef289ffe0f645e0e1e8e7", "ja": "……わたくしも、それほど詳しくはありませんけど。\n紗代子、顔をあげてくださいまし。", "zh": "……我也并没有那么精通就是了。\n纱代子，请把头抬起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "57d54410f2ea8e1581615eb34ccf0f37484cf0c4dbb09f2c38fb889474b6eda8", "ja": "千鶴さん……。", "zh": "千鹤小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1040_038chz", "source_sha256": "3a94b5ff531fdc2e8387c66fe013fc81454ba0584d9016b11d5482a545aca0f0", "ja": "恋愛のせつなさというのは、きっと……\n自分の思ったとおりにいかないこと、ですとか……。", "zh": "所谓的恋爱情愫之苦，必定是……\n比如无法如自己所愿，之类的事情吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1041_038chz", "source_sha256": "32139f5e82e872a35c59d1b6787ad66daa9c0e807fc1d9883d45e8849ecea59f", "ja": "それに思い悩む心や、もどかしい想い、情景……。\nそういうものではないかと、わたくしは思いますわ。", "zh": "以及为此苦恼的心情、焦急难耐的思绪，还有那样的情景……  \n我想，应该就是这些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "4d02a037c48636c97b0bd8278f9bf39ef5ce7429672bb1cd6f461795c6e13d4f", "ja": "思ったとおりにいかないこと……。\n思い悩む心、もどかしい想い……情景……！", "zh": "事与愿违的事……\n烦恼的心绪、焦急的心情……还有情景……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "0affc4cb7ad7601830c6663833179893fd20b9bd904fe9da35d4e44282ab61b3", "ja": "わあ～♪　聞いてるだけで、\nとってもせつない気持ちになっちゃいました！", "zh": "哇～♪　光是听着，\n心里就变得好难过呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "9f0fb1bcd0031a8200e5e1590a95b45cc624139b6eb65e09f22a4514c3d0f7b4", "ja": "楽しそうだけどな……。でも、マジでいいとこ\nついてると思う。さすが大人だぜ、千鶴！", "zh": "看起来很开心嘛……不过，我觉得你确实说到点子上了。真不愧是大人啊，千鹤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "693f1cb967470f030bdd7fcfe60a0309b586412f053ad14fbdd1b5cd30040dab", "ja": "あっ、参考になりそうですの？　それはよかった……\nコホン。まあ、当然ですわ！　オーッホッホッホ！", "zh": "啊，能派上用场吗？那真是太好了……\n咳咳。哼，这也是理所当然的！哦～呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1046_027say", "source_sha256": "eac8be46895627bc334ad8077792a7a28827d8626df0298a84e065e700be2264", "ja": "でも……そういうのはきっと、\nいくらレッスンしても身につきませんよね？", "zh": "不过……那种东西，恐怕不管怎么练习，都学不会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1047_038chz", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1048_027say", "source_sha256": "0686f47cbd3a97a7f66e0e921841d052ba4d12c8737976aee8ca60e3a18aed9d", "ja": "どうしよう。私、頑張ることしかできないのに。\nこのままじゃ、いつまでも……。", "zh": "怎么办才好。我明明只会努力。\n这样下去的话，就永远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1049_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa24edccee987fc2368e93b46b114bc69cb536ef6505025fd42ac1d058b33654", "ja": "つっても、いきなり大人にもなれないしな。\nうーん……。", "zh": "话虽这么说，也不可能一下子就变成大人啊。\n嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1050_048rei", "source_sha256": "9bc5230fac8e69217b031f604fd37e650a3416f804b9815ac5413406b2333f54", "ja": "うーん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1051_038chz", "source_sha256": "82ee5650c5b4b5f9bc824c9ef3d1683a695c72198e4bb4f582c6bc8391266451", "ja": "そ、そうですわね。\nですから、それは……えっと……。", "zh": "是、是这样呢。\n所以，这个……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1052_p", "source_sha256": "bf843c2551d17128d56739c9d015fe2a8abd58d8c95ae90c9cf9f1bd65ad05e9", "ja": "（千鶴さんが目で合図を送ってきている……。\nそうですよね千鶴さん、こういうときは……！）", "zh": "（千鹤小姐正用眼神向我示意……\n是啊，千鹤小姐，这种时候应该……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_03_1053_p", "source_sha256": "ebcbe88efcf598b2df6290ddbfe037cfe4c2370e95379eb5065bf70b3a882546", "ja": "よし。今日の打ち合わせは、中止にしよう！", "zh": "好。今天的商谈就取消吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
